  <div class="tags">
    <span class="tag tag-purple">Diffusion LMs</span>
    <span class="tag tag-cyan">On-Policy Distillation</span>
    <span class="tag tag-green">Interactive</span>
  </div>
  <h1>OPDLM: Convert Any AR Model to a Diffusion LM in 66M Tokens</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Training an autoregressive model like Qwen as a diffusion model normally costs trillions of tokens.
    On-Policy Distillation closes the train-inference gap by teaching the student on the exact states it
    will see at test time — cutting training to just 66M tokens, a 7,000× reduction, with competitive
    performance across math, code, and reasoning.
  </p>
