<h3>Zero-Shot Thinking Mode</h3>
<p>
  Since OPDLM is initialized from Qwen3 (which supports chain-of-thought reasoning),
  it retains the thinking capability without ever training on thinking data. At
  inference time, simply prompting with <code>&lt;think&gt;&lt;/think&gt;</code> tags
  boosts AIME-24 from 18.6% to an even higher score — zero additional training cost.
</p>

<div class="vp">
  <div class="vp-head">
    <span class="vp-title">OPDLM-8B: think vs. non-think mode</span>
  </div>
  <div class="vp-body">
