</div>

<p>
  OPDLM demonstrates that ARLM-to-DLM conversion can be a post-training step rather
  than a pretraining phase — the same position SFT and RLHF occupy in the modern
  training pipeline. The ability to retain capabilities like multilingual and thinking
  without seeing them during conversion is strong evidence that the ARLM's knowledge
  is genuinely preserved, not just approximately replicated.
</p>
